
!app/src/model_*.json
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!examples/**/*.csv
!examples/**/*.json
!examples/**/*.ndjson
!tests/**/*.csv
# Generated outputs
# IDE / OS
# JSON / NDJSON outputs — generally ignore, but commit small samples under examples/
# Logs
# Python
# Source data — never commit (PHI risk even after anonymization)
# Tauri / Node — app/.gitignore handles the rest
# Trained model artifacts (runtime; src/syntha/models/ is source code and IS tracked)
# and the Tauri app's bundled model assets (which are regenerated by CI).
*$py.class
*.csv
*.egg-info/
*.joblib
*.log
*.ndjson
*.pkl
*.py[cod]
*.swp
.DS_Store
.eggs/
.idea/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv-mcp/
.venv/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
app/dist/
app/node_modules/
app/src-tauri/gen/
app/src-tauri/target/
build/
data/raw/*
dist/
output/
venv/
